/-!
# 20-Tick Shadow Leave Semantics, Part B1 (Store, Close, Relocation & Whole Leave)

Forward semantics of the tail of `leaveP20 j` (from `core20Prog j` through `leaveClose20`) across
all 9 twenty-tick blocks (`j : Fin 9`, `s = 165, 185, ..., 325`):
- Companion magnitude restore (`smallA20`, `smallM20`, `smallC20`) + mask release (`1557`, `1558`),
- Mapped next-block far/side flag store (`leaveStoreMapped20`, handling both `j < 8` into 20-tick
  blocks and `j = 8` into 15-tick block `s = 345`),
- History restore & low rail store (`leaveLowClose20`),
- 10-prefix-swap side-flag clear & relocation (`leaveClose20`),
- Master forward theorem `whole20_result` and frame preservation `leave20_keeps`.
-/

